        <mxCell id="tracer-text" parent="1" style="text;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=3;" value="Wraps the final make step:&#xa;  bomtrace3 make -j$(nproc)&#xa;&#xa;On each execve() syscall:&#xa;  1. PTRACE_ATTACH to child&#xa;  2. Read args from tracee memory&#xa;  3. Compute SHA-256 gitoid hashes&#xa;  4. Append to raw logfile&#xa;  5. PTRACE_CONT to resume" vertex="1">
